   "node_type": "proof",
   "text": "\\begin{proof}\nThe kernel cannot exceed the peak $P$. Moving $Q$ bytes takes at least $Q / B$ seconds, so the $F$ operations run at most at $F / (Q/B) = I \\cdot B$ operations per second.\n\\end{proof}",
